{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "98b3803c-7d06-402d-87f8-c3f0298ff9e0",
    "name": "北辰（BeiChen）",
    "description": "北辰 x-BeiChen 后端接口集合（FastAPI）。\n\n目录结构：api → v1 → 接口分类 → 具体接口。\n完整服务前缀为 /api/admin/v1，其中固定段 /admin 已并入 base_url 变量。\n\n变量说明：\n- base_url：服务地址（默认本地开发 http://localhost:6666/api/admin/v1）\n- task_id / event_id / customer_id：路径参数示例值，调试时替换为真实 ID\n\n接口分类（19 个）：健康检查 2、认证 2（预留 501）、Agent 任务管理 7、商务对话 Agent 2、数据监控 2、客户管理 Agent 4。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "api",
      "description": "接口根目录（对应 URL 前缀 /api）。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "v1",
          "description": "v1 版本目录（对应 URL 前缀 /api/admin/v1）。",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "健康检查",
              "description": "服务存活与版本探针，不依赖数据库，供负载均衡 / 运维监控使用。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "GET /health 服务健康检查",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["health"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回服务存活状态及依赖组件（database / redis / agent_runtime）状态，供负载均衡与运维探针使用，不依赖数据库。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /version 应用版本信息",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/version",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["version"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回 app_id / app_name / version / python_requires。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "认证",
              "description": "认证接口为生产级特性，本期骨架返回 501，二期接入 JWT + RBAC。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "POST /auth/login 登录（预留）",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"changeme\"\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["auth", "login"]
                    },
                    "description": "二期接入 JWT + RBAC，当前返回 501 Not Implemented。body 为未来形态示例，现不被消费。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "POST /auth/refresh 刷新令牌（预留）",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"refresh_token\": \"\"\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
                    },
                    "description": "令牌刷新预留接口，二期接入，当前返回 501。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Agent 任务管理",
              "description": "Agent 编排管理接口：注册表查询、任务提交/列表/详情、人工接管 resume、协作事件查询。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "GET /agents/specs Agent 注册表列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/agents/specs",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["agents", "specs"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回当前已注册 Agent 清单（type / name / description / enabled），无需查库。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "POST /tasks 提交 Agent 任务",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"task_type\": \"monitor\",\n    \"payload\": {\n        \"account_id\": \"acc_default\",\n        \"campaign_id\": \"camp_001\"\n    }\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["tasks"]
                    },
                    "description": "提交任务并同步执行。\n\ntask_type 显式指定则直接路由；留空时由 LLM 根据 query/payload 自然语言动态选择。\n\npayload 按 Agent 选用字段：\n- monitor: {account_id?, campaign_id?}（account_id 默认 acc_default）\n- business_chat: {message!, customer_id?}\n- customer: {scope?（full/due_followup/by_ids/report，默认 due_followup）, customer_ids?（by_ids 必填）, report_type?（daily/weekly）}"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /tasks 任务列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks?page=1&page_size=20",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["tasks"],
                      "query": [
                        {
                          "key": "status",
                          "value": "",
                          "disabled": true,
                          "description": "按任务状态过滤：pending/running/success/failed/waiting_human 等"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "task_type",
                          "value": "",
                          "disabled": true,
                          "description": "按任务类型过滤：monitor/business_chat/customer"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page",
                          "value": "1"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page_size",
                          "value": "20"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "分页查询任务列表（管理后台任务面板）。status / task_type 两个可选过滤参数在 Params 中勾选启用。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /tasks/{task_id} 任务详情",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks/{{task_id}}",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["tasks", "{{task_id}}"]
                    },
                    "description": "查询单个任务详情（含 payload / result / status / thread_id / error_message）。task_id 用集合变量，调试时替换为真实 ID。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "POST /tasks/{task_id}/resume 恢复人工接管任务",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"decision\": \"approve\",\n    \"remark\": \"同意系统建议\",\n    \"extra\": {\n        \"budget\": 1500\n    }\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks/{{task_id}}/resume",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["tasks", "{{task_id}}", "resume"]
                    },
                    "description": "人工接管：恢复被 interrupt 暂停（waiting_human）的任务。\n\ndecision: approve / reject / adjust；extra 可携带调整后的数值（如预算）。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /events 协作事件列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/events?page=1&page_size=20",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["events"],
                      "query": [
                        {
                          "key": "event_type",
                          "value": "",
                          "disabled": true,
                          "description": "按事件类型过滤：alert_raised/suggestion_created/followup_created/report_generated 等"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page",
                          "value": "1"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page_size",
                          "value": "20"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "协作事件分页列表（审计面板 / 事件溯源）。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /events/{event_id} 协作事件详情",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/events/{{event_id}}",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["events", "{{event_id}}"]
                    },
                    "description": "单条协作事件详情，含完整 payload。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "商务对话 Agent",
              "description": "business_chat 子图语义化入口：客户咨询发送（intent → RAG → generate）与人工接管回复。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "POST /chat/send 发送客户咨询消息",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"message\": \"预算花太快了怎么办？\",\n    \"customer_id\": \"cus_001\"\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/chat/send",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["chat", "send"]
                    },
                    "description": "提交一条商务对话消息（business_chat 子图：intent → RAG → generate），同步返回 reply / intent / sources；命中人工关键词时 status=waiting_human。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "POST /chat/{task_id}/human-reply 人工接管回复",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"decision\": \"approve\",\n    \"remark\": \"人工回复：已为您记录并加急处理\",\n    \"extra\": {}\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/chat/{{task_id}}/human-reply",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["chat", "{{task_id}}", "human-reply"]
                    },
                    "description": "恢复被 interrupt 暂停的对话任务，从检查点续跑并返回后续结果。decision 仅接受 approve/reject/adjust。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "数据监控",
              "description": "monitor 子图：巡检触发（按账户提交监控任务）与告警事件查询。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "POST /monitoring/scan 手动触发监控巡检",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "[\n    \"acc_default\"\n]"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/monitoring/scan",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["monitoring", "scan"]
                    },
                    "description": "对每个账户提交一个 monitor 任务，返回 task_ids。请求体为字符串数组；传 null 或缺省则使用默认账户 acc_default。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /monitoring/alerts 告警事件列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/monitoring/alerts?page=1&page_size=20",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["monitoring", "alerts"],
                      "query": [
                        {
                          "key": "page",
                          "value": "1"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page_size",
                          "value": "20"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "查询 alert_raised 告警事件（管理后台告警面板）。suggestion_created 属建议单，不在此口径内。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "客户管理 Agent",
              "description": "customer 子图：跟进巡检 / 指定客户 / 全量 / 报表任务，以及跟进记录与报表查询。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "POST /customers/run 提交客户管理 Agent 任务",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"scope\": \"due_followup\"\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/run",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["customers", "run"]
                    },
                    "description": "提交 customer 子图任务。\n\nscope 取值：\n- due_followup（默认）跟进到期巡检\n- by_ids 指定客户（customer_ids 必填）\n- full 全量巡检\n- report 报表任务\n\nby_ids 示例：{\"scope\": \"by_ids\", \"customer_ids\": [\"cus_001\"]}"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "POST /customers/reports/trigger 手动触发客户报表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n    \"report_type\": \"daily\",\n    \"customer_ids\": null\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/reports/trigger",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["customers", "reports", "trigger"]
                    },
                    "description": "不经子图，直接由 ReportService 做确定性模板聚合并落库 customer_reports。report_type: daily / weekly；customer_ids 为 null 时全量。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /customers/reports 报表列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/reports?page=1&page_size=20",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["customers", "reports"],
                      "query": [
                        {
                          "key": "report_type",
                          "value": "",
                          "disabled": true,
                          "description": "daily / weekly"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "customer_id",
                          "value": "",
                          "disabled": true
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page",
                          "value": "1"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page_size",
                          "value": "20"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "报表分页列表（自动出报表与手动触发的报表在此统一可查）。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "GET /customers/{customer_id}/followups 跟进记录列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}/followups?page=1&page_size=20",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["customers", "{{customer_id}}", "followups"],
                      "query": [
                        {
                          "key": "page",
                          "value": "1"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page_size",
                          "value": "20"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "查询指定客户的跟进记录（customer 子图确定性产出，可审计）。customer_id 用集合变量，默认 cus_001。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:6666/api/admin/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "task_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "event_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customer_id",
      "value": "cus_001",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
